s both the requested timeframe and the stated quality constraint.","materiality":"Material context for the delivery timeline."},{"excerpt":"De ontwikkeling begon met de ervaring van aanvragers.","claim":"The team began development by focusing on the experience of people applying for refunds.","category":"chronology","label":"F0 faithful","evidence":"My team focused on the users applying for refunds first","narrative":"De aanvragerservaring werd eerst naar alpha gebracht","narrativeRelation":"supports","origin":"none","explanation":"The source explicitly says the team focused on refund applicants first.","materiality":"Material to the reported order of development."},{"excerpt":"Die werd eerst naar de alphafase gebracht","claim":"The applicant-focused work was taken to the alpha phase or assessment first.","category":"chronology","label":"F1 minor immaterial imprecision","evidence":"My team focused on the users applying for refunds first and this is what we took to the alpha assessment.","narrative":"De aanvragerservaring werd eerst naar alpha gebracht","narrativeRelation":"supports","origin":"propagated","explanation":"The source says the team took its focus on refund applicants to the alpha assessment; describing the experience itself as brought to the alpha phase slightly blurs the distinction between the work and the assessment.","materiality":"Low; the sequence remains clear."},{"excerpt":"plannen voor het werk van caseworkers kwamen later.","claim":"Plans for the caseworker user or their work came later than the applicant-focused work.","category":"chronology","label":"F0 faithful","evidence":"Plans for the caseworker user came later.","narrative":"plannen voor caseworkers kwamen later","narrativeRelation":"supports","origin":"none","explanation":"This matches the source’s stated sequence.","materiality":"Material to the account of development order."},{"excerpt":"Tijdens de private beta wisselden tweewekelijkse sprints af: in de ene periode werden aanvragen aa