al approach."},{"excerpt":"Dit was de werkwijze van het team onder tijdsdruk","claim":"The described practices were the team’s approach while working under time pressure.","category":"scope","label":"F0 faithful","evidence":"We were initially asked to deliver the service in a matter of weeks, which put huge pressure on everyone","narrative":"Presenteer dit als de werkwijze van dit team","narrativeRelation":"supports","origin":"none","explanation":"The source explicitly describes the tight deadline as putting pressure on the team, and presents these practices as its approach.","materiality":"Material context; it does not generalize the approach."},{"excerpt":"de beschrijving stelt niet vast dat die keuzes de lancering ... hebben veroorzaakt.","claim":"The source account does not establish that the described choices caused the launch.","category":"cause","label":"U insufficient evidence to settle","evidence":"This was key to us being able to build the service so quickly while ensuring it met user needs.","narrative":"zonder ze als bewezen oorzaak van de lancering ... voor te stellen","narrativeRelation":"supports","origin":"propagated","explanation":"The source attributes a contribution to building the service quickly, but does not explicitly say the choices caused the launch within twelve weeks or provide independent evidence establishing that causal link. The piece’s cautious wording is therefore not settled by the source either way.","materiality":"Material because it qualifies the account’s causal interpretation of the timeline."},{"excerpt":"de beschrijving stelt niet vast dat die keuzes ... resultaten hebben veroorzaakt.","claim":"The source account does not establish that the described choices caused the reported results.","category":"cause","label":"F0 faithful","evidence":"This was key to us being able to build the service so quickly while ensuring it met user needs. The service has now been available for five weeks and has already received over 100k applications with 92.6% user satisfaction and an 80.2% completion rate.","narrative":"zonder ze als bewezen oorzaak van de lancering of resultaten voor te stellen","narrativeRelation":"supports","origin":"none","explanation":"The source credits the approach with supporting rapid development and meeting user needs, but does not link it to the later application, satisfaction, or completion figures.","materiality":"Material because it avoids presenting reported metrics as causal evidence."}]}

